:" 必然重合；","end":25,"kind":"text","start":19}],"source_index":6},{"fragments":[{"content":"用CLT极限与切比雪夫界说明结论。","end":42,"kind":"text","start":25}],"source_index":6},{"fragments":[{"content":"\\frac{\\sqrt n(\\bar X_n-\\mu)}{\\sigma}\\xrightarrow{d}N(0,1)","end":59,"kind":"math","start":0},{"content":"，","end":60,"kind":"text","start":59},{"content":"\\bar X_n\\xrightarrow{P}\\mu","end":88,"kind":"math","start":60},{"content":"，","end":89,"kind":"text","start":88},{"content":"\\operatorname{Var}(\\bar X_n)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{n}","end":138,"kind":"math","start":89},{"content":"，其中 ","end":142,"kind":"text","start":138},{"content":"0<\\sigma^2<\\infty","end":161,"kind":"math","start":142},{"content":"。","end":162,"kind":"text","start":161}],"source_index":7}],"schema":"text-fragment-plan-v2","source_sha256":"a72b010ec16ebf15b9b7538f342e8e29b4512b4e1f36522887846b1078b6fed7","sources":["说明独立同分布且具有正的有限方差时，中心极限定理描述的标准化样本均值极限，并区别未标准化均值的变化。","声明一般定理的独立同分布和正有限方差条件；演示例单独固定为 $U[0,1]$。","分别展示 $\\bar X_n$ 和 $Z_n=\\sqrt n(\\bar X_n-\\mu)/\\sigma$，不可混用两种横轴。","用 $f_2(t)=4t$ 或 $4(1-t)$ 的分段式画均值密度，说明均值是和的缩放。","比较 $n=2,5,10,30$ 时的材料；实际密度须据推导，经验直方图须据真实样本，不虚构数据。","展示未标准化均值方差 $\\frac{1}{12n}$ 趋零；标准化后才讨论趋向固定的 $N(0,1)$。","正态曲线只作比较，不宣称 $n=30$ 必然重合；用CLT极限与切比雪夫界说明结论。","$\\frac{\\sqrt n(\\bar X_n-\\mu)}{\\sigma}\\xrightarrow{d}N(0,1)$，$\\bar X_n\\xrightarrow{P}\\mu$，$\\operatorname{Var}(\\bar X_n)=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{n}$，其中 $0<\\sigma^2<\\infty$。"]}